=\"notranslate\">nix-build -A qownnotes https://github.com/r-ryantm/nixpkgs/archive/ec45e9439b7077afca58cc8d43f4672b4801e73c.tar.gz\n</code></pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Or:</p>\n<div class=\"snippet-clipboard-content notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"nix build github:r-ryantm/nixpkgs/ec45e9439b7077afca58cc8d43f4672b4801e73c#qownnotes\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><code class=\"notranslate\">nix build github:r-ryantm/nixpkgs/ec45e9439b7077afca58cc8d43f4672b4801e73c#qownnotes\n</code></pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">After you've downloaded or built it, look at the files and if there are any, run the binaries:</p>\n<div class=\"snippet-clipboard-content notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"ls -la /nix/store/1k55vmiqw6jv88vs26xg2yhlzc9ag83b-qownnotes-24.12.1\nls -la /nix/store/1k55vmiqw6jv88vs26xg2yhlzc9ag83b-qownnotes-24.12.1/bin\"><pre class=\"notranslate\"><code class=\"notranslate\">ls -la /nix/store/1k55vmiqw6jv88vs26xg2yhlzc9ag83b-qownnotes-24.12.1\nls -la /nix/store/1k55vmiqw6jv88vs26xg2yhlzc9ag83b-qownnotes-24.12.1/bin\n</code></pre></div>\n<hr>\n</details>\n<br>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Pre-merge build results</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">We have automatically built all packages that will get rebuilt due to<br>\nthis change.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This gives evidence on whether the upgrade will break dependent packages.<br>\nNote sometimes packages show up as <em>failed to build</em> independent of the<br>\nchange, simply because they are already broken on the target branch.</p>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\"><code class=\"notranslate\">nixpkgs-review</code> result</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Generated using <a href=\"https://github.com/Mic92/nixpkgs-review\"><code class=\"notranslate\">nixpkgs-review</code></a>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Command: <code class=\"notranslate\">nixpkgs-review</code></p>\n<hr>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\"><code class=\"notranslate\">x86_64-linux</code></h3>\n<details>\n  <summary>✅ 1 package built:</summary>\n  <ul dir=\"auto\">\n    <li>qownnotes</li>\n  </ul>\n</details>\n<hr>\n<h6 dir=\"auto\">Maintainer pings</h6>\n<p dir=\"auto\">cc <a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/pbek/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/pbek\">@pbek</a> <a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/totoroot/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/totoroot\">@totoroot</a> for <a href=\"https://github.com/ryantm/nixpkgs-update/blob/main/doc/nixpkgs-maintainer-faq.md#r-ryantm-opened-a-pr-for-my-package-what-do-i-do\">testing</a>.</p>\n<div class=\"markdown-alert markdown-alert-tip\" dir=\"auto\"><p class=\"markdown-alert-title\" dir=\"auto\"><svg class=\"octicon octicon-light-bulb mr-2\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M8 1.5c-2.363 0-4 1.69-4 3.75 0 .984.424 1.625.984 2.304l.214.253c.223.264.47.556.673.848.284.411.537.896.621 1.49a.75.75 0 0 1-1.484.211c-.04-.282-.163-.547-.37-.847a8.456 8.456 0 0 0-.542-.68c-.084-.1-.173-.205-.268-.32C3.201 7.75 2.5 6.766 2.5 5.25 2.5 2.31 4.863 0 8 0s5.5 2.31 5.5 5.25c0 1.516-.701 2.5-1.328 3.259-.095.115-.184.22-.268.319-.207.245-.383.453-.541.681-.208.3-.33.565-.37.847a.751.751 0 0 1-1.485-.212c.084-.593.337-1.078.621-1.489.203-.292.45-.584.673-.848.075-.088.147-.173.213-.253.561-.679.985-1.32.985-2.304 0-2.06-1.637-3.75-4-3.75ZM5.75 12h4.5a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.5h-4.5a.75.75 0 0 1 0-1.5ZM6 15.25a.75.75 0 0 1 .75-.75h2.5a.75.75 0 0 1 0 1.5h-2.5a.75.75 0 0 1-.75-.75Z\"></path></svg>Tip</p><p dir=\"auto\">As a maintainer, if your package is located under <code class=\"notranslate\">pkgs/by-name/*</code>, you can comment <strong><code class=\"notranslate\">@NixOS/nixpkgs-merge-bot merge</code></strong> to automatically